#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.rst:2
msgid "max\\_drawdown"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:1
msgid "Compute the maximum drawdown along the specified dimension."
msgstr "指定された次元に沿って最大ドローダウンを計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:3
msgid ""
"The maximum drawdown is the largest peak-to-trough loss of a price or "
"equity curve, i.e., the most negative value of the drawdown series:"
msgstr "最大ドローダウンは、価格や資産曲線（エクイティカーブ）におけるピークからボトムまでの最大の損失、すなわちドローダウン系列の最も負の値です:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:6
msgid ""
"\\text{MDD} = \\min_i \\left(\n"
"    \\frac{x[i]}{\\max_{j \\le i} x[j]} - 1 \\right)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{MDD} = \\min_i \\left(\n"
"    \\frac{x[i]}{\\max_{j \\le i} x[j]} - 1 \\right)\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:10
msgid ""
"Following the convention of quantitative finance libraries such as "
"empyrical, the result is returned as a non-positive number (e.g., "
"``-0.35`` denotes a 35% peak-to-trough loss).  A monotonically non-"
"decreasing series yields ``0.0``."
msgstr "empyrical などのクオンツファイナンスライブラリの慣例に従い、結果は非正（0 以下）の数として返されます（例えば ``-0.35`` は、ピークからボトムまでの 35% の損失を表します）。単調非減少の系列では ``0.0`` になります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:16
msgid "The input tensor containing strictly positive prices."
msgstr "厳密に正の価格を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:19
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to compute the maximum drawdown. Default is -1 "
"(the last dimension)."
msgstr "最大ドローダウンを計算する次元。デフォルトは -1（最後の次元）です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:23
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has ``dim`` retained or not. Default is "
"``False``."
msgstr "出力テンソルが ``dim`` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは ``False`` です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:27
msgid ""
"A tensor with the specified dimension reduced (retained with size 1 if "
"``keepdim`` is ``True``), containing the most negative drawdown values as"
" non-positive numbers."
msgstr "最も負のドローダウン値を非正（0 以下）の数として含む、指定された次元が縮約されたテンソル（``keepdim`` が ``True`` の場合、その次元はサイズ 1 で保持されます）。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:33
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:35
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([100.0, 120.0, 90.0, 130.0, 65.0])\n"
">>> QF.max_drawdown(x)\n"
"tensor(-0.5000)"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([100.0, 120.0, 90.0, 130.0, 65.0])\n"
">>> QF.max_drawdown(x)\n"
"tensor(-0.5000)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:39
msgid ""
">>> # 2D example: one value per row.\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[100.0, 120.0, 90.0, 130.0, 65.0],\n"
"...                   [10.0, 20.0, 30.0, 40.0, 50.0]])\n"
">>> QF.max_drawdown(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([-0.5000,  0.0000])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 2 次元の例: 行ごとに 1 つの値。\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[100.0, 120.0, 90.0, 130.0, 65.0],\n"
"...                   [10.0, 20.0, 30.0, 40.0, 50.0]])\n"
">>> QF.max_drawdown(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([-0.5000,  0.0000])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:45
msgid ""
">>> QF.max_drawdown(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[-0.5000],\n"
"        [ 0.0000]])"
msgstr ""
">>> QF.max_drawdown(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[-0.5000],\n"
"        [ 0.0000]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:49
msgid ""
"Any NaN along the reduced dimension makes the result NaN, because "
":func:`drawdown` propagates NaN stickily and ``amin`` propagates NaN as "
"well."
msgstr "縮約される次元に沿って NaN が 1 つでもあると、結果は NaN になります。:func:`drawdown` が NaN を粘着的に伝播し、``amin`` も同様に NaN を伝播するためです。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:54
msgid ":func:`drawdown`: The full drawdown series this function minimizes."
msgstr ":func:`drawdown`: この関数が最小値を求める対象となるドローダウン系列全体。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:56
msgid ":func:`nanmin`: Minimum function that skips NaN values."
msgstr ":func:`nanmin`: NaN 値をスキップする最小値関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.max_drawdown.max_drawdown:57
msgid ":func:`mmin`: Moving minimum function."
msgstr ":func:`mmin`: 移動最小値関数。"

